  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Communications Training Program In Dominican Republic and Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin Minga Per (Minga Per) is a nongovernmental organization dedicated to improving social and economic conditions in rural communities in Latin America and the Caribbean. Through continued support Minga Per will develop a new methodology for training grassroots organizations in strategic communications. It will provide training in communications, planning and evaluation for about 85 leaders drawn from current and former IAF grantee partners in Dominican Republic and Peru and their grassroots partners. Participants will receive subgrants to implement their communications strategies and document lessons and results to share with donors and other interested parties. The benefits should flow to up to 15,000 people connected with beneficiary organizations, their communities and partners.</narrative>
  </description>
